SUMMARY:Hiking 101 Workshop at Evergreen Brickworks
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bruce Trail Club\nAre you new to hiking or interested 
 in getting started? Join us at the Evergreen Brick Works for a one hour se
 ssion in the BMO Atrium from 12:30–1:30 pm for tips on what to pack\, hi
 king with kids\, transit hikes\, and hiking with the Toronto Club\, follow
 ed by a Q&A.\n\nGuided Hikes: We’re running two separate hikes from Ever
 green Brick Works and will be at the Farmers Market all morning.\n\nRegist
 er here: https://torontobrucetrailclub.org/join-us-at-evergreen-brickworks
 -on-saturday-june-13
